<title>JAPAN: Toyo Shutter to buy back 3 mln shares.</title>
<headline>Toyo Shutter to buy back 3 mln shares.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Toyo Shutter Co Ltd, a shutter manufacturer, said on Monday it plans to buy back three million of its own shares and change company regulations to carry out the repurchase more swiftly.  </p>
<p>The decision needs to be approved at its shareholders' meeting on June 27.</p>
<p>Toyo Shutter said the planned change to company regulations would allow it to decide on share repurchases at directors' meetings. Currently, share buy-backs need to be decided at shareholders' meetings.</p>
</text>
